# AI Poster Studio — Environment Variables
# $0 stack — none of these are required to run locally.
# Ollama runs on your machine; data is stored in .data/.

# --- Optional: Ollama base URL (default http://localhost:11434) ---
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434"

# --- Optional: app URL (default http://localhost:3000) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# --- Optional: Ollama model (default llama3.2:3b) ---
# OLLAMA_MODEL="llama3.2:3b"